  "id": "hot-cognition",
  "term": "hot cognition",
  "definition": "Hot cognition is thinking that involves emotionally important information. It includes processes such as emotion processing, motivation and reward-related behavior, and social understanding, and problems in these processes are seen across many neuropsychiatric disorders.",
